{
    "title": "Football Score",
    "description": "The app contains everything you'd expect from Live Score on your mobile, including live sport scores for football.\r\nLive Score: Live Sport Updates\r\nFootball Live Scores, Stats, Plays, & Results\r\nSports App - Scores, News, Stats & Watch Live\r\nGet the Live Score for The 2022 World Cup.\r\nMost popular and extensive Football/Soccer live score app for iPhone.\r\nFootball Mania has more than 1000 leagues, 10.000 teams and 100.000 players from countries all over the world.\r\n\r\nOne football - Live Football Scores, Results & News\r\n\r\nLIVESCORE - Best app ever for live scores, live odds in Soccer and\r\n\r\n\u2714FOOTBALL NEWS, LIVE FOOTBALL SCORES, HIGHLIGHTS, TRANSFERS, STATS AND VIDEOS\r\nAll you need to know about your favourite Football teams: fixtures, insider news, transfer news and rumours, player profiles and video channels are always on hand in the team section.\r\n\r\n\u2714PERSONALISED CONTENT\r\nWhether you\u2019re mad for Mo Salah or Messi, crazy about Chelsea or Spurs, select your favourite Football players, clubs, national teams,Football Legends and leagues under the \u2018Following\u2019 tab, to get up-to-the-minute Football news articles and scores that matter to you and your team. Get the latest Football news and scores daily, written by our international newsroom of Football journalists from all over the globe.\r\n\r\n\u2714ALL FOOTBALL LEAGUES & TEAMS\r\nExplore the world of Football with access to all international competitions, and teams. Whether you follow Manchester City or Manchester United in the FA Cup or Premier League, Real Madrid or Barcelona in La Liga or Bayern Munich and Dortmund in the Bundesliga you can rely on Onefootball for all Football scores and news updates. From the first match of the season to the Champions League final in June. If you love La Liga, have Premier League passion or are a Bundesliga buff, One football has you covered!\r\n\r\n\u2714LIVE FOOTBALL COMMENTARY & INSTANT PUSH NOTIFICATIONS\r\nFollow our expert analysis, predict the results of all Football matches and vote for the best player. Get minute by minute updates during Premier League, Champions League and International Football games. Customise push notifications to receive squad and team news, key events, red cards and goal alerts for club and international competitions you want to hear about. Whether it\u2019s about a surprise Man United team selection or a last-minute winner in the Champions League knockout phase, we can keep you updated.\r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n- Live football / soccer scores from leagues, cup competitions and championships worldwide\r\n- More than 1000 live football / soccer games followed live every week during the season\r\n- Fixtures Results\r\n- Live Commentary\r\n- Detailed match information\r\n- Live league tables for football\r\n- Select your own refresh period\r\n- User friendly\r\n- Time & Date localized\r\n- Very fast and responsive even on slow connection\r\n- Minimal data transfers\r\n- Bandwidth friendly with our data compression\r\n- free football\r\n- Live updates! Scores and game status update in real time.\r\n- View schedules for the entire league, conferences, divisions, or teams.\r\n- Includes listings and times for each game.\r\n- No internet connection required. Check the NFL football schedule anywhere and at any time.\r\n- Never miss a game or your favorite team, simply tap to set an alarm to be notified before a game starts!\r\n- Follow all your favorite football leagues",
